        <title>Mycelium-Labs Integration Architecture</title>
        <section>6.2 Impact Propagation</section>
        <snippet>Impact score = edge_weight / (hops ^ 1.5). Thresholds: score >= 0.5 flagged critical, score >= 0.1 flagged moderate, score less than 0.1 no flag. Edge weights: DEPENDS_ON 1.0, CONFLICTS_WITH 0.9, SUPERSEDES 0.8, DERIVED_FROM 0.7, VALIDATES 0.6, REFINES 0.5, ENABLES 0.5, INFORMS 0.3.</snippet>
      </doc>
      <doc>
        <path>docs/concepts/mycelium-labs-architecture.md</path>
        <title>Mycelium-Labs Integration Architecture</title>
        <section>3.2 Memgraph Schema</section>
        <snippet>8 edge types with weights. Wiki sections map to edge types: Dependencies to DEPENDS_ON, Derived From to DERIVED_FROM, Informs to INFORMS, Validates to VALIDATES, Supersedes to SUPERSEDES, Conflicts With to CONFLICTS_WITH, Enables to ENABLES.</snippet>
      </doc>
